{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rendagor is a 2D Topdown Shooter starring a Rendagor Corporation service robot, just another robot... or maybe not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the Rendagor C. secrets in story mode or try you hand at the arcade mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Either way, shoot,beat 'n blast enemies (or the game enviroment) with a large set of weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight against the failed experiments of Rendagor Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/72e51928511cd2395aaba3d5a6dc9a50.poster.avif?t=1751526624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/72e51928511cd2395aaba3d5a6dc9a50.webm?t=1751526624\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rocket fists, lasers, machine guns and much more! Use all the arsenal at your disposal to destroy Rendagor Corp's enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/4ceb1bc6d141efa7d153617ff7205b71.poster.avif?t=1751526624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/4ceb1bc6d141efa7d153617ff7205b71.webm?t=1751526624\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve small puzzles and explore the maps well for additional loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/e18498882257685aeec026c1951e28fa.poster.avif?t=1751526624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/e18498882257685aeec026c1951e28fa.webm?t=1751526624\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend R-Coins to purchase what you need. An R-Shipping drone will make the delivery to your location.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/50714a4e807fc7e59fe67d8911a0bf1d.poster.avif?t=1751526624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/50714a4e807fc7e59fe67d8911a0bf1d.webm?t=1751526624\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your robot using the R-Chips you recover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/3b3ebf36849652d032c328e1c1e760aa.poster.avif?t=1751526624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/3b3ebf36849652d032c328e1c1e760aa.webm?t=1751526624\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill bosses at the end of each level to advance to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/15570f5410fbe95bf878996ec4968428.poster.avif?t=1751526624\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/15570f5410fbe95bf878996ec4968428.webm?t=1751526624\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face waves of random enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/SPAWN_WAVE.gif?t=1751526624\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each wave you will receive an R-Chip and can choose one among three random bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/END_WAVE.gif?t=1751526624\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/LAST_WAVE_BOSS.gif?t=1751526624\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343710?t=1751526624","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343710?t=1751526624","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/39bce5cd1b58b02e2b9c5d9f670082846df3c252/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751526624","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/39bce5cd1b58b02e2b9c5d9f670082846df3c252/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751526624","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description